OL,3,GNEWSAChloe Mitchell murder accused
OL,4,A'dismembered body', court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis article contains details that some
OL,7,Fmay find distressing
OL,9,FThe man accused of killing Chloe
OL,10,FMitchell murdered her at his house
OL,11,Fbefore dismembering her body and
OL,12,Fdisposing of it in wheelie bins, a
OL,13,Fcourt has been told.
OL,15,FBrandon Rainey, formerly of James
OL,16,FStreet, Ballymena, denies murdering the
OL,17,F21-year-old in June 2023 and preventing
OL,18,Fthe lawful burial of her remains.
OL,20,FAt Belfast Crown Court on Wednesday
OL,21,Fmorning the prosecution opened its case
OL,22,Fagainst Rainey.
